<h1 style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;">UTM Builder</h1>
<p>Track marketing campaigns by adding UTM parameters to your links.</p>
<h2>UTM Parameters</h2>
<table><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Example</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>utm_source</code></td><td>Traffic source</td><td>google, facebook, newsletter</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>utm_medium</code></td><td>Marketing medium</td><td>cpc, email, social</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>utm_campaign</code></td><td>Campaign name</td><td>summer_sale_2026</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>utm_term</code></td><td>Paid search keyword</td><td>link shortener</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>utm_content</code></td><td>Ad variation</td><td>banner_v2</td></tr>
</table></div>
<h2>UTM Templates</h2>
<p>Save frequently-used UTM parameter sets as templates. Go to <strong>UTM Templates</strong> in the sidebar to create and manage templates. When creating a link, apply a template with one click.</p>
